/// A group of radio buttons with one selection (WinUI's `RadioButtons`). The items are shown as
/// [`RadioButton`]s: an item that is a radio button is its own container, and another item is the
/// content of a radio button. The selection is the selection of the items control (`SelectedIndex`,
/// `SelectedItem`, `SelectionChanged`), kept with the checked state of the containers. The arrow
/// keys move the focus and the selection within the group without wrapping, Tab enters the group at
/// the selected button, and Ctrl with an arrow key moves the focus only. The template is the
/// control theme of the WinUI theme (`Controls/RadioButtons.xaml`, from WinUI's
