/// `HeaderContentPresenter` and the `ItemsRepeater` `InnerRepeater`); the theme sets the items
/// panel, a [`RadioButtonsPanel`](crate::primitives::RadioButtonsPanel) with the spacing of the
/// resources `RadioButtonsColumnSpacing` and `RadioButtonsRowSpacing`. The Fluent and Simple themes
/// have no template for it (docs/porting/winui-controls.md, section 5.1). The exclusive check is
/// the radio button group manager's: the containers are the logical children of the group and have
/// no group name, so checking one unchecks the others. The group itself only checks the container
/// of a new selection, and unchecks the container of the old one when no container is checked
